atically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉许愿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n在<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>界面的常驻结交活动中，点击视频左下方许愿按钮可进入许愿界面。\n<Assistant_Property2>许愿</>指定人脉后，可提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n<Assistant_Title2>许愿规则：</>\n可许愿的人脉为可结交的传说人脉。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，获取许愿目标的概率提高到<Assistant_Property1>80%</>。如果获得的传说人脉不是许愿目标，那下次获得的传说人脉必定为许愿目标。\n常驻结交中，<Assistant_Property1>每周</>可以生效<Assistant_Property1>2次</>许愿效果，周一重置。每当结交人脉<Assistant_Property1>110次</>，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。\n许愿一位人脉后，若误操作选错许愿目标，可点击取消许愿按钮取消许愿。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wishing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nIn the permanent connection event in the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Make Connections</> interface, click the wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the wishing interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>Wishing </> for a specific connection can increase the probability of obtaining that connection when making connections. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wishing Rules: </>\nConnections that can be wished for are legendary connections that can be made. \nAfter wishing, when you obtain a legendary connection, the probability of getting the wished target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the legendary connection obtained is not the wished target, the next legendary connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wished target. \nIn permanent connections, you can have <Assistant_Property1>2</> wish effects take effect <Assistant_Property1>per week</>, resetting on Monday. Every time you make <Assistant_Property1>110</> connections, you can obtain one additional wish attempt. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset attempts. \nAfter wishing for a connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the cancel wish button to cancel the wish. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationships]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
