    ["知识皇冠的消失并未带走庄园的污染，反而让深处的某种存在更加蓬勃地发育。 来自圣堂的指引更是触目惊心：“最深处的污染来自红月……将在此处诞生新的子嗣…… ”\n守护廷根的值夜者小队，必将阻止这一切！\n\n<Notice>当副本首领奖励次数归零时，会自动获得对应的</><Highlight>再战任务</><Notice>，完成后可以获得额外奖励。再战任务每周一8点重置。</>\n\n<Notice>组队模式下和</><Highlight>家族</><Notice>成员一起进入副本，若未达到推荐非凡评分，可获得属性增益补正。补正效果与团队同家族成员数目和家族等级相关。</>"] = "The disappearance of the Crown of Knowledge did not take away the manor's corruption; instead, it allowed some existence deep within to flourish even more. The guidance from the Cathedral is even more shocking: \"The deepest corruption comes from the Red Moon... A new offspring will be born here...\" \nThe Nighthawks squad guarding Tingen will surely stop all of this! \n\n<Notice>When the dungeon boss reward count reaches zero, you will automatically receive the corresponding </><Highlight>Rematch Quest</><Notice>, which grants extra rewards upon completion. Rematch Quests reset every Monday at 8:00. </>\n\n<Notice>In team mode, entering a dungeon with </><Highlight>Family</><Notice> members allows you to receive an attribute bonus correction if the recommended Beyonder rating is not met. The correction effect is related to the number of team members from the same family and the family level. </>",
